    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T19:11:58Z",
    "body": "It should be noted that these elements were largely dropped from the specification in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2742, since only Gecko exposed an implementation at the time. It's unfortunate that this interest was not known back then.\r\n\r\nThat said, a new implementation could mean that there's a case for bringing them back.",
